### commit 99c1e08d01632f1fe73f3359860aeb60dea3cabc (HEAD -> main)
### Author: Git-creat7
### Date:   Sun May 24 16:15:28 2026 +0800


### AOP 权限切面测试
### 覆盖 @RequireSpaceRole 注解化的 4 个方法：
###   - updateSpace    @RequireSpaceRole(OWNER, ADMIN)
###   - addMember      @RequireSpaceRole(OWNER, ADMIN)
###   - updateMemberRole @RequireSpaceRole(OWNER)
###   - deleteSpace    @RequireSpaceRole(OWNER)
###
### 角色矩阵：4 个用户分别扮演 OWNER / ADMIN / MEMBER / OUTSIDER（非成员）
### 第一次运行：从注册开始全跑；后续可从"登录"段开始

### =================== 1. 注册 4 个测试用户 ===================

### 注册 OWNER
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aop_owner",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 注册 ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aop_admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 注册 MEMBER
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aop_member",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 注册 OUTSIDER（非成员，用于测试外人调用）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aop_outsider",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### =================== 2. 登录获取各角色 Token ===================

### 登录 OWNER → token_owner
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aop_owner",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token_owner", response.body.data);
%}

###

### 登录 ADMIN → token_admin
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aop_admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token_admin", response.body.data);
%}

###

### 登录 MEMBER → token_member
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aop_member",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token_member", response.body.data);
%}

###

### 登录 OUTSIDER → token_outsider
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "aop_outsider",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token_outsider", response.body.data);
%}

###

### =================== 3. 初始化测试空间和成员 ===================

### OWNER 创建空间
POST http://localhost:8080/space
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "AOP测试空间",
  "description": "用于权限切面测试"
}

###

### 拿到 space_id（从列表里挑出刚创建的那个）
GET http://localhost:8080/space/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const spaces = response.body.data;
    const target = spaces.find(s => s.name === "AOP测试空间");
    client.global.set("space_id", target.id);
    client.log("space_id = " + target.id);
%}

###

### OWNER 添加 ADMIN（角色 ADMIN）
POST http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "username": "aop_admin",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### OWNER 添加 MEMBER（角色 MEMBER）
POST http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "username": "aop_member",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

###

### 拿到 admin_user_id 和 member_user_id（用于改角色接口）
GET http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

> {%
    const members = response.body.data;
    const adminRow = members.find(m => m.username === "aop_admin");
    const memberRow = members.find(m => m.username === "aop_member");
    client.global.set("admin_user_id", adminRow.userId);
    client.global.set("member_user_id", memberRow.userId);
    client.log("admin_user_id = " + adminRow.userId);
    client.log("member_user_id = " + memberRow.userId);
%}

###

### =================== 4. 测试 updateSpace @RequireSpaceRole(OWNER, ADMIN) ===================

### [正] OWNER 改名 → 预期 success
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "AOP测试空间-OWNER改",
  "description": "OWNER改名"
}

###

### [正] ADMIN 改名 → 预期 success
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

{
  "name": "AOP测试空间-ADMIN改",
  "description": "ADMIN改名"
}

###

### [反] MEMBER 改名 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

{
  "name": "MEMBER非法改名",
  "description": "应被拦截"
}

###

### [反] OUTSIDER 改名 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_outsider}}

{
  "name": "OUTSIDER非法改名",
  "description": "应被拦截"
}

###

### [反] 不存在的 spaceId → 预期 "空间不存在"
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/999999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "name": "改不存在的空间",
  "description": "应被切面拦截"
}

###

### =================== 5. 测试 addMember @RequireSpaceRole(OWNER, ADMIN) ===================

### [反] MEMBER 加成员 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
POST http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

{
  "username": "aop_outsider",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

###

### [反] OUTSIDER 加成员 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
POST http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_outsider}}

{
  "username": "aop_owner",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

###

### [正] ADMIN 加成员（把 outsider 拉进来）→ 预期 success
POST http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

{
  "username": "aop_outsider",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}

###

### =================== 6. 测试 updateMemberRole @RequireSpaceRole(OWNER) ===================
### 注意：这个比 updateSpace 严格，ADMIN 也不能调

### [反] ADMIN 改 MEMBER 角色 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
###（虽然 ADMIN 是空间管理员，但改角色只允许 OWNER）
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members/{{member_user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### [反] MEMBER 改自己角色 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members/{{member_user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### [反] OUTSIDER 改 MEMBER 角色 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members/{{member_user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_outsider}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### [正] OWNER 把 MEMBER 升级为 ADMIN → 预期 success
PUT http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}/members/{{member_user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### =================== 7. 测试 deleteSpace @RequireSpaceRole(OWNER) ===================
### 放最后做，因为软删后空间就查不到了

### [反] ADMIN 删空间 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

###

### [反] MEMBER 删空间 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_member}}

###

### [反] OUTSIDER 删空间 → 预期 "您没有权限操作该空间"
DELETE http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_outsider}}

###

### [正] OWNER 删空间 → 预期 success
DELETE http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###

### [反] 删完之后再删一次 → 预期 "空间不存在"（验证切面里的空间存在性校验）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/space/{{space_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_owner}}

###
